  <p class="app-subtitle">Frequently Asked Questions</p>

  <p class="para">This FAQ is intended to assist candidates who have received a provisional offer of admission through NLSAT 2026. It should be read together with the provisional offer letter, the fee invoice generated through the admissions portal, and any subsequent instructions sent by the NLSIU Admissions Team. In case of any inconsistency, the specific communication issued to the candidate by NLSIU will prevail.</p>

  <p class="bold" style="margin-top:14px;">Important Deadlines</p>

